{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54691","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 二十九 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 二十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太阳畔，气盖（京本作「贯」）日当中。\n白色东西连卯酉，主忧社稷（京本作「宗社」）重灾凶，改号任神龙。\n（龙名曰丧门。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54691.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54691","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}